      "privateNotes": "",
      "publicNotes": "<p>A Bonded Soul companion in its Beast base form. Link it to its owner with <strong>Sync Bonded</strong> on the owner's sheet: it then has the owner's level, AC, saves, Perception and Hit Points, and its Strikes use the owner's best attack modifier with their highest attribute to damage. Drag evolutions from the Apex Talents compendium onto it; the pool is 3 + the owner's level points, reallocated during daily preparations.</p><p>Imprecise scent 60 feet. On a hit against a creature it moved at least 20 feet toward, the target is Off-Guard until the end of its turn.</p>"
